🛡️ Nmap — SOC Analyst ke liye kya hai?
Nmap = Network Mapper
WORK- Network par kaunse hosts/devices available hain, unke kaunse ports open hain, aur un ports par kya services chal rahi hain — ye discover karna.

1. Nmap actually kya discover karta hai?

📌Suppose company ke network mein:
192.168.1.10   → Windows PC
192.168.1.20   → Linux Server
192.168.1.30   → Web Server
192.168.1.40   → Database Server

📌SOC analyst ko pata lagana hai:
Kaun alive hai?
        ↓
Kaunse ports open hain?
        ↓
Kaunsi service chal rahi hai?
        ↓
Kaunsa version?
        ↓
Kya unexpected exposure hai?

Nmap isi visibility ko provide karta hai.


💡2. Sabse basic scan
nmap 192.168.1.10

Example:
PORT     STATE SERVICE
22/tcp   open  ssh
80/tcp   open  http
443/tcp  open  https

📌Meaning:
Port	     Service	  SOC meaning

22	        SSH	      Remote administration
80	        HTTP	    Web service
443	        HTTPS    	Secure web service
3389	      RDP	      Windows remote access
445	        SMB	      Windows file sharing
53          DNS	      DNS service
25	        SMTP	    Mail service
